#passage(("The Quran is not Saj'. You have Saj', and then you have poetry. Poetry follows patterns of rhymes, and it has different seas, seas of rhymes, like البحر الطويل (the Long Metre), المديد (the Protracted), and all of these different seas of rhymes and pattern of rhymes. If you say poetry, you have to fit into one of these 16 rhymes. Now the Quran can have rhymes, but it doesn't fit into any of these 16 seas. So it's not poetry! And at the same time, it's not Saj', which is just speech without rhymes. The Quran is its own unique category of speech.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Clip-React| Islam Should Be Banned?! The Quran CAN Be Replicated?! | Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6hIakD_VbeU", ((2460, "41:00–41:43"),))
