#passage(("\"Hudhaifa bin alYaman went to 'Uthman, and then he told him about the people of Sham. And he said: \"Ô chief of Believers, save this Nation before they differ about the Quran, as the Jews and Christians did before.\"\"", "The most important thing this Narration is showing us is: at this time, 20 years after Prophet Muhammadﷺ, and Islam is a massive empire, at the time of Uthman bin Affan, he is saying \"before they differ about the Quran\", which means that at this time, 20 years after the Prophet ﷺ, they had no differences about the Quran. If they already differed, how can he say \"save the Nation before they differ\"?", "And what's, on top of that, even more interesting is: he says \"like the Jews and the Christians did\". So that is another evidence for those people who look for evidences: \"Where is the evidence in Islam that the books of the Jews and Christians have been corrupted?\" This narration is an evidence! Because Hudhaifa is saying there to Uthman: \"before they differ over their Book like those people differed over their book\".", "\"So 'Uthman sent to Hafsa: \"Send us the manuscripts of the Quran, so that we may compile the quranic materials in perfect copies and return the Manuscript to you.\"\" This narration is from Sahih alBukhari. \"Hafsa sent it to 'Uthman.\" Zaid bin Thabit is the one who collected these manuscripts after the death of the Prophetﷺ, and they were with Abu Bakr. They are the same original copies that were written down at the life of the Prophetﷺ. So 'Uthman ordered Zayd bin Thabit, Abdullah bin Azzubayr and a few other Companions to rewrite the manuscripts in perfect copies: so, copy from the original Manuscripts of the Quran, rewrite them and make a standard copy. And then he's saying the Quran was revealed in the tongue of Quraysh, etc.", "\"They have written many copies. 'Uthman returned the original Manuscripts to Hafsa, and 'Uthman sent to every province one copy of what they have copied, and ordered that all the quranic materials, whether written in fragmentary manuscripts or whole copies, be burnt.\" Did you hear anything about \"all the memorisers of the Quran dying\"? Because this whole Narration was supposed to prove that all the memorisers of the Quran were dying!",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Arrogant Christian Insults Muslim And Rage-Quits After Being Exposed! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BsxEUnoU36k", ((1292, "21:32–21:46"), (1315, "21:55–22:37"), (1363, "22:43–23:02"), (1388, "23:08–24:31"), (1476, "24:36–25:33"),))
