#passage(("Here you can see a miracle that people can look at and can see that this Quran cannot be from Prophet Muhammadﷺ, because he was from the tribe of Quraysh. And as we know, even today, if you bring anyone, English, or American, or whatever it is, and you start telling him: \"Start speaking to me in different dialects of English, start speaking to me in a Scottish dialect or an Australian dialect\", they're not going to be able to do it! They might do it for a few minutes, but then they will make mistakes. So, how did the Prophetﷺ recite the same Quran, or bring revelation of the same Quran, in 7 different dialects of the Arabs? We're talking about 6,000 verses here, of the Quran, of the most eloquent speech to ever exist! So, this by itself is a miracle for people of understanding, for people who have intellect to see that this text could not have been coming from the Prophet Muhammadﷺ himself.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “The History Of The Quranic Text| A Breakdown From Revelation To Compilation| Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JjBR2JbHN6o", ((578, "9:38–10:18"),))
