#passage(("Muslims in general have been accused of Shifting the goalposts in regards to the topic of the preservation of the Quran. That's absolutely ridiculous, and the reason is because Muslims have been getting this to the masses for a thousand years. Publishers are printing this stuff for students of knowledge, for Lay people; everyone has access to this stuff. If you've read the introductory Works in quranic Sciences, then you are aware of the existence [of qira'at].",), "Farid Responds, “David Wood Shifts Goal Posts on Quran Preservation!”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7XRt1FLCESs", ((78, "1:18–3:12"),))
