#passage(("The amount of things mentioned in the Quran are amazing. Allah says (alAnbya21:30): أَوَلَمْ يَرَ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوٓا۟ أَنَّ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضَ كَانَتَا رَتْقًۭا فَفَتَقْنَـٰهُمَا ۖ وَجَعَلْنَا مِنَ ٱلْمَآءِ كُلَّ شَىْءٍ حَىٍّ ۖ. In this verse, Allah speaks about everything created from water, which is another sign, that we know everything is made from cells, and every cell is 60-70% water. But also, Allah speaks about the universe expanding by saying: وَٱلسَّمَآءَ بَنَيْنَـٰهَا بِأَيْي۟دٍۢ وَإِنَّا لَمُوسِعُونَ (addhariyyat51:47). (And the Samaa), which is referring to the universe which is around us, we built with power; أَيْي۟دٍۢ is from آدَ، يؤودُ (verbs), from strength; وَإِنَّا لَمُوسِعُونَ (and we are expanding it).", "Now we know that by Hubble telescope, just recently in 1900s: we are using it to look and see the celestial bodies are moving from each other, something called the Redshift, and that redshift is the wavelength of the galaxies, and things are moving far from each other. And you're telling me 1400 years ago someone knows what redshift is, the wavelength of galaxies, and the Hubble telescope! But this is what the Quran is saying.", "Think about that. Don't think about the things that the Quran got right; think about the things that the Quran could have gotten wrong. How many? The Quran is 6,000 verses; how many verses talks about the earth and the human? And you take the beliefs of the people 1400 years ago, it would be full of problems, just like the people when they tried to take the beginning of the Bible, the first few chapters, and how they're contradicting one another, like the sun was created, the moon, the earth. That's why you had many Christians, after science has advanced, left Christianity. Many of these whom they would call scientists left it, because they realised that it's not compatible with what they would call modern science.", "We're not saying science is a measurement. But the Quran will tell you about things which are accurate and established, unchanging. And that's why you see certain things that are theories, wrong, incorrect, can be there in science and can change with time. But the Quran, whatever it tells you, is the reality. Now, the only one who can do that, it's not just a human being, because he couldn't get this information from any human being; it has to be from The One Who made it. It has to be The One Who fashioned it, The One Who created it, because He knows how it is. When you create something, you know what that thing is.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Islam Unveiled: Compelling Evidence For The Truthfulness Of Islam | Chicago - USA | Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AUFsBco_CF0", ((2914, "48:34–49:15"), (2965, "49:25–49:46"), (2988, "49:48–50:25"), (3029, "50:29–51:04"),))
