#passage(("[Ridvan creates] a false definition to make the Quran contradict reality, arguing that it says that the sky is solid. It doesn't say that. Even with this definition of the sky being made up of gas, when it should be defined as the fabric of space and time, there is the mathematical possibility of wormholes opening within the sky.", "Firstly, the verse does not mention that the Earth's atmosphere is solid. Also, does everyone understand that if a canopy is penetrated by a rock that it is not a canopy? The protective nature of the atmosphere is established scientifically. After establishing that the sky is indeed like a canopy, there is nothing strange about it being referred to as a canopy that is raised without pillars.",), "Farid Responds, “[DEBUNKED] The Science Mistakes of the Quran - Apostate Prophet”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6RTehKGfdCU", ((869, "14:29–14:48"), (922, "15:22–16:18"),))
