ave the waste of the cow, that also goes in the small intestine of the cow and into the big intestine of the cow, and then the waste comes out of the cow. So waste goes through the same thing; it goes through the small intestine of the cow. So Allah now is talking about how the pure milk comes out, and PURE of this waste which goes through the same small intestine, and PURE of blood. Because, in the small intestine, the nutrients now are absorbed into the bloodstream and then carried to the udder of the cow, where the milk comes out.", "So, what I would say in this verse, rather than to say it's an error in the Quran, I would ask the question: How is this ACCURATE, BEAUTIFUL, VERY VERY VERY ACCURATE DESCRIPTION given by a Desert Bedouin Arab 1400 years ago?!",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Clip-React| The Quran Has Multiple Errors?! Omar And The Pen & Paper Incident| Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_Q0bo07LFNs", ((0, "0:00–1:05"), (73, "1:13–1:33"), (111, "1:51–2:09"), (134, "2:14–3:14"), (198, "3:18–3:51"), (256, "4:16–5:48"), (350, "5:50–6:09"), (372, "6:12–6:45"), (410, "6:50–7:25"), (450, "7:30–8:25"),))
