#passage(("An interpretation is you have an ambiguous term that has more than one meaning, and then you try to interpret it to understand what is the correct meaning. Now if I give you a clear command, \"Drink water\", you don't interpret my command to drink water or not to drink water, because it's a clear command: \"Drink water\" means drink water. If there's a bottle next to you, \"drink from this bottle next to you\", you drink from the bottle next to you.", "The Quran is very clear. Prophetﷺ shows us how to understand the Quran, how to implement it. That's why when he was living, he was implementing it, so we can understand it.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Atheist Challenges The Muslim Understanding Of God! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tLX_TIbqsc4", ((335, "5:35–5:48"), (364, "6:04–6:08"),))
