 what the verse is referring to. You cannot misrepresent that and say the truth is within you, which the verse is not saying in any shape or form.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “The Muslim Lantern, Sneako and Arab Debate Religion! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QiBVA3ZecoI", ((1790, "29:50–30:25"), (1851, "30:51–31:50"), (1917, "31:57–33:26"),))
