#passage(("It was in Heaven. It wasn't on earth in Islam, because Allah says in the Quran (alBaqara2:38) ٱهۡبِطُوا۟ مِنۡهَا جَمِیعࣰاۖ (Descend from it, all of you). So you are descending from Heaven. And it is also where the Angels were, and Angels don't exist on earth. So if it's a place where Angels are there and they prostrated to Adam, and all of that, then all of that happened in a place where the Angels are present, and that is Heaven.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Christian Debates Muslim On The Original Sin! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BjYGPQ-G5RM", ((834, "13:54–14:14"),))
